Improvement Guidance1: Ensure that the Flask application (`main.py`) runs without any issues before any tests are executed. This can be verified by running `python main.py` separately and checking the logs for errors.

Error Analysis2: Unable to locate the "Logout" link.
Improvement Guidance2: Implement a logout feature that removes the user session and directs users to the login page. Include a logout link on the dashboard or other appropriate locations.

